<abstract id="abstract">
<p id="p-0001" num="0000">A mounting rail with a low-friction chamfered lip lets accumulated snow slide off photovoltaic modules instead of bridging between rows.</p>
</abstract>
<claims id="claims">
<claim id="CLM-00001" num="00001">
<claim-text>1. A mounting rail for a photovoltaic module, the rail having a chamfered lip coated with a low-friction polymer.</claim-text>
</claim>
<claim id="CLM-00002" num="00002">
<claim-text>2. The rail of <claim-ref idref="CLM-00001">claim 1</claim-ref>, wherein the lip is inclined at 20 to 35 degrees.</claim-text>
</claim>
</claims>
